{"ticker":{"symbol":"006120.KS","name":"SK디스커버리","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":72400.0,"change_pct":0.016853932584269593,"market_cap":1303399497728.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":0.027624309392265192,"week52_low":42750.0,"week52_high":73000.0,"sector":"Energy","industry":"Oil & Gas Refining & Marketing","country":"South Korea","city":"Seongnam-si","employees":58,"website":"https://www.skdiscovery.com","business_summary":"SK Discovery Co., Ltd., through its subsidiaries, engages in environmental friendly materials, vaccines/pharmaceuticals, energy/chemicals, and real estate development businesses in South Korea and internationally. The company offers environmental friendly materials and healthcare solutions in the areas of treatment, prevention, and diagnosis to patients. It also engages in the storage of LPG; tank terminal; and power generation business, as well as real estate development of commercial facilities, office buildings, hotels, urban housings, luxury housings, and renewable energy generation facilities, such as solar and wind power generation. The company was formerly known as SK Chemicals Co., Ltd. and changed its name to SK Discovery Co., Ltd. in December 2017. SK Discovery Co., Ltd. was founded in 1969 and is based in Seongnam-si, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"SK디스커버리(주)는 자회사를 통해 국내외에서 친환경 소재, 백신/의약품, 에너지/화학, 부동산 개발 사업을 영위하고 있습니다. 환자의 치료, 예방, 진단 분야에서 친환경 소재와 헬스케어 솔루션을 제공하는 회사입니다. 또한 LPG 저장에도 참여하고 있습니다. 탱크 터미널; 발전사업과 상업시설, 오피스빌딩, 호텔, 도시형 주택, 고급주택, 태양광, 풍력발전 등 신재생에너지 발전시설의 부동산 개발사업을 하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 이전에 SK케미칼주식회사로 알려졌으며 2017년 12월 SK디스커버리주식회사로 사명을 변경했습니다. SK디스커버리주식회사는 1969년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 성남시에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"정유","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":8717115148760.0,"operating_income":362198951860.0,"net_income":427432392